window.products.push({"id":377030,"name":"ShakeSphere Tumbler VIEW: Protein Shaker Bottle Smoothie Cup with Clear Window, 24 oz - Bladeless Blender Cup Purees Fruit, No Mixing Ball - Drink Pow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rmyi3DOyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SEE-THROUGH VIEWING WINDOW – You spoke. We listened. Presenting the upgraded version of our original blender bottle smoothie cup: the Tumbler View. Along with all the same award-winning benefits as our original protein shaker bottle, the Tumbler View features a see-through window for accurate measurements. INNOVATIVE BALL-FREE CAPSULE – Look cool, perform better. #NoCorners means no stuck powder or clumps. Great as a gym bottle shaker cup or pre workout bottle. Unique capsule shape makes quick work of the thickest powders and ingredients like peanut butter. No blender ball or mesh grid needed. BLENDS FRUIT WITH NO BLADES - Shake for an extra 5 seconds and you can even enjoy soft fruit in your shake for the ultimate post-workout recovery boost! (Remember: it's a bladeless bottle blender, not a magic miracle device. Fruit must first be soft, ripe, and cut into small pieces) EFFORTLESS CLEANING, NO ODOR – Modern design with viewing window. Anti-gag reflex, no-odor, smell-proof design is freezer safe. NOT dishwasher safe. But that doesn't matter. Because all it takes is 5 seconds of rapid rinsing with cold water, and you're ready for your next shake. THE WORLD’S #1 SHAKER. PERIOD. Voted Best Splurge product by Shape.com for a reason! ShakeSphere has continually evolved and continues to innovate and improve, integrating feedback over the years from athletes, fitness enthusiasts, bodybuilders, and coaches to produce the World’s #1 Shaker. Period.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rmyi3DOyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHAKESPHERE","source_asin":"B083VZKVVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083VZKVVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083VZKVVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
