window.products.push({"id":377172,"name":"Vocrite Shag Area Rug for Bedroom, Durable Small Plush Fluffy Fuzzy Rugs for Living Room, Anti-Slip Rectangle Furry Shaggy Carpets for Kids Room Nurse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815gcULTKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Premium Material】Unlike most area rugs in the Amazon, VOCRITE rugs are made of top-quality velvet and created through a 12-step process including shearing, combing, tying, tufting, trimming, etc. This fluffy rug of multi-color is soft and beautiful with great toughness. It is odor-free and won’t experience shedding or fading, making it an excellent option for contemporary home decoration. 【Anti-slip Design】With thousands of non-slip latex particles on the bottom, this fluffy rug is held to the floor effectively and won’t slide easily.Walking on a fuzzy area rug with hundreds of millions of plush fiber is like wandering on a cloud. Such a soft touch makes it an ideal area rug for young children, babies, and pets to crawl or play, bringing them a sense of warmth and cozy. 【Easy to Clean and Maintain】This fur area rug can be vacuumed on the lowest gear of vacuum cleaner for daily care and wiped clean with a damp cloth if there is a small amount of staining. When a thorough cleaning is required, please wash it by hand and lay it flat to dry to fluff it up. To prolong the life of the carpet, machine washing is not recommended. 【Multi-scenario Use】Our velvet coarse wool rug adopts a classic solid color with a simple and modern design style. Its simple color adds warmth and elegance to your home room. This push rug is suitable for girls’ and boys’ bedrooms, living rooms, nurseries, dormitories, playrooms, apartments, home offices, study or foyer, etc., providing warmth and comfort between your family and the cold floor. 【Service Guarantee】For dust-proof, our area rug is vacuum-packed. Hence when you unpack it, it will look flat, and it will take up to 3 to 5 days for it to assume its natural and fluffy shape. If you have any questions, kindly email us and we will reply within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815gcULTKQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vocrite","source_asin":"B0BFHSMVVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFHSMVVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFHSMVVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":377173,"name":"Macood Air Fryer Parchment Paper 100 Pcs 8.5 Inch Unbleached Square Perforated Paper for Air Fryers/Baking/Cooking/Steaming Basket (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TUKRWcznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8.5 inch Air Fryer Parchment Paper - Perfect for 8.6 to 9.6 inch square shape air fryer or cake pan, microwave, or 10.5 to 11.5in oval shape air fryer (diagonal length).（Please measure the dimension of the inner basket and choose the suitable size you need）Compatible with Philips, Cozyna, Secura, NuWave Brio, Chefman, GoWISE USA, COSORI and More. Healthy & Eco-friendly - 100% unbleached natural wood pulp filter food grade paper is no fluoresce, non-toxic, biodegradable and eco-friendly. Easy to Clean & Non-Stick - Our air fryer parchment paper made with nonstick food grade premium quality baking paper, will protect your air fryers and steaming basket from food residue, make clean up a breeze. Perforated for Hot Air Circulation - Macood air fryer perforated parchment is professionally designed for the air fryers, enough and proper holes help to speed up the steam circulation in air fryers or steamers. Meanwhile, these air fryer basket liners are oil-proof and waterproof, enhancing the taste, bringing you delicious. Heat Resistanceh - Waterproof, grease proofing and heat resistant up to 450℉ (230℃) will make your parchment liners with perfect thickness intact during cooking. ATTENTION: When you put the air fryer parchment paper in the basket, don't preheat your air fryer without food on top! The food should at least cover the 2/3 the area of the parchment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TUKRWcznL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Macood","source_asin":"B09F6N37DX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F6N37DX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F6N37DX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
