window.products.push({"id":377438,"name":"Stock Your Home Paper Baking Pans (25 Pack) - 9.5 Oz Paper Pie Pans - Round Loaf Pans for Baking - Paper Baking Pans - Disposable Pie Pans - Disposabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811vumb4YWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Proudly Made in the USA: Our small round paper loaf pans are perfect for baking and displaying round cakes, fruit tarts, cheesecakes, pies, quiche and more! Made of high quality corrugated baking paper, our paper loaf pans for baking provide the strength and durability needed to hold your baked goods. The brown background and gold floret accent print of our paper baking pans creates a beautiful display worthy of your delicately crafted desserts. Grease Resistant: With our disposable loaf pans, no pre-greasing is needed! Our pans are designed with a grease resistant, poly-coated interior to create an easy release from the pan. The rigid construction allows our paper loaf pans to freely stand upright, making it easier for you to pour in your batter. Oven Safe: Our paper baking pans are oven safe up to 390 degrees, allowing you to transfer your baked goods from the oven straight to the display case! They’re also microwave safe, freezer safe and recyclable. When you’re done, simply toss our disposable bread pans in the trash. Super Space Saver: The stackable design of our baking pans helps you save on kitchen-counter, shelf, and cabinet space. Our pans also are made to be disposable so you won’t have to spend time washing metal baking pans. Perfect for bakeries, restaurants, food trucks, takeout and delivery, bake sales, fundraisers, country fairs, farmers markets, and more! Great Value Pack: Our value pack comes with 25 small round paper baking pans. Each pan has a capacity of 9.5 ounces. Pan measures approximately 5” Top Diameter, 4.75” Bottom Diameter, and 1.625” Height.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811vumb4YWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stock Your Home","source_asin":"B09H3BBCGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H3BBCGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H3BBCGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
