window.products.push({"id":377535,"name":"S.H.I.E.L.D. Beer Mug, Comics Fan Stein, Wedding Gift For Groomsman, Personalized Beer Stein, Custom Gift for Men, Gift for Him, Geek Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FvwfRyynS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mark your loved ones' special occasions with a unique, personalized present. Are you looking for a special gift to give to a special person - a friend, family member, spouse or colleague? Aren't you tired of the impractical, unremarkable and forgettable presents people usually resort to in these cases? Would you like to see a unique, personalized and memorable gift that everyone can appreciate and enjoy? Our beer mugs is just exactly what you're looking for! This wooden beer stein is made to our high quality standards - handmade oak wood mug accomplished in a light brown color. The stainless steel cup inside the wooden casing of the mug will keep the temperature of the beer colder, for a longer period of time during the summer. Nothing says “cheers” like the end of a hard day and a drink with mates! Our mugs will elevate any home bar into a respect-worthy collection. Keep your favorite spirit in style with this generously sized and expertly crafted steins. We can also engrave your personal image on the copper label, just write us a message!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FvwfRyynS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WildMugs","source_asin":"B07ZCYBLFR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZCYBLFR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZCYBLFR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":377536,"name":"Omega Nutrition Center Juicer (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":180.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ddseYPv1L._AC_SL1056_.jpg","description":"Omega Nutrition Center Model 8003 - White Wheatgrass, Fruit, Vegetable Juicer and more! Features & SpecificationsThe Omega 8003 Nutrition Center Juicer is quick, efficient and affordable compared to most! The Omega Juicer Model 8003 provides an easy solution for multi-purpose functions not just limited to juicing. It is easy to clean, carries a lengthy 10-Year Warranty and comes in at a decent price for all the functions it can accomplish. The Omega name has been around for more than 30 years and continues to produce a high quality machine. The Omega 8003 Juicer replaces the older Omega 8001 and 8002 models. Low revolution auger speedThe Omega Juicer 8003 has a slow turning 80 RPM auger which preserves nutrients longer than high revolution juicers.While some people may be concerned that this means it juices very slowly the speed difference is not all that noticeable. The extra time is well spent in preserving all of the nutrients in the juice and creating a much better tasting juice too!QualityWhile the price tag may seem high - consider the fact that this juicer has a 10-Year Warranty. We have clients who have had their juicer (older models) for 10-20 years without having any problems. All of the parts on this machine are built to last with no loose ends (they fit together solidly!) Functions:Vegetable juicer! - Kale, beets, wheatgrass, spinach, yams, leafy greens, pine needles, arrowroots, carrots, peppers, radishes and moreFruit juicer! - Apples, pears, peaches, carrots, oranges, grapes, kiwi, melon, tomatoes, and more. Does an excellent job on both hard and soft fruits.Meat / Fish Mincer - Mince and chop just about anything! Seasonings Chopper / Mincer - Minces onion, scallion, garlic, red pepper, ginger radish and so much more!Soy milk - make fresh soymilk!Nut buttersPasta extruder - homemade spaghetti, linguini, and breadsticksFrozen dessertsMincing / ChoppingGrinding - grind coffee beans and flourBaby foodsWheatgrass juicer and leafy greensFeatures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ddseYPv1L._AC_SL1056_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omega Juicers","source_asin":"B000CC3IKU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CC3IKU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CC3IKU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
