window.products.push({"id":377689,"name":"Ashler 20 x 20 Pillow Inserts (Set of 2), Throw Pillow Inserts with 100% Cotton Cover, 20 Inch Bed and Couch Pillow Inserts, Indoor and Outdoor Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mQERIQSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton 🌀Hypoallergenic Cotton Fabric: The fabric of the throw pillow inserts is made from 100% cotton that has superior softness and durability against polyester. Cotton cover is more breathable, so it's less vulnerable to mold and mildew than polyester pillows 🌀Soft & Abundant Down Alternative Filling: The throw pillow filling features a blend of 7D+3D siliconized microfibers made from primordial materials; guaranteed no use of recycled or waste fiber where it's quite common on inexpensive pillows. The couch pillows are lightweight, plump, and soft 🌀Fit Any Pillow Cover Beautifully: Ashler pillow inserts set of 2 are available in multiple sizes to fit your needs; they can restore the loft and plumpness of your old pillow, making them look springy and fluffy on your sofa or bed again 🌀Machine Washable: These 20x20 pillow inserts are sturdy enough to hold up to machine washing due to their durable cotton fabric and premium filling. They won't turn clumpy after washing and can fluff back up after air dried 🌀More Than an Adornment: Ashler decorative pillow inserts not only refresh your throw pillows, they are so comfy and soft to sleep on and make a nap on the couch cozy. White pillows are vacuum packed; set aside for a few hours to allow them to get fully inflated","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mQERIQSWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ashler Home Deco","source_asin":"B0B4ZX42SB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4ZX42SB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4ZX42SB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
