window.products.push({"id":377777,"name":"Chic Home Avila 20 Piece Comforter Set Ruffled Ruched Designer Bag Bedding-Sheets Window Treatments Decorative Pillows Shams Included, Queen, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":101.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WAd0UpHYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A fashion forward bedding collection with everything you need for a complete bedroom décor makeover. The comforter features a designer inspired ruffled and ruched technique. Window treatments, super-soft microfiber sheets, design coordinated shams and embellished deco pillows are included to complete the look. Specifications: • Size: Queen• Color Scheme: Navy• Piece Count: 20• Set Includes:• 1pc Comforter (90” x 90”)• 2pc Shams (20” x 26”)• 2pc Decorative Pillows (12” x 18”)• 1pc Decorative Pillow (18” x 18”)• 1pc Flat Sheet (90” x 108” + 3\")• 1pc Fitted Sheet (60” x 80” + 12”)• 2pc Pillowcases (21” x 27” + 3\")• 4pc Curtain Panels (40” x 84”)• 2pc Valances (84” x 18”)• 4pc Curtain Tiebacks• Materials: Luxuriously brushed microfiber fabric, hypoallergenic synthetic down alternative fillingFabric and Design: • Silky soft brushed microfiber cotton-feel material• Sophisticated and elegant ruffled ruched technique with embroidery detailsFeatures: • Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning • Hypoallergenic alternative down filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down materials• Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitchingCare Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low* Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffinessThe digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in computer monitors, we cannot be responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WAd0UpHYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B07PBYXNMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377777","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PBYXNMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PBYXNMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
