window.products.push({"id":377971,"name":"JLCROTENGRA 2 Pack Decorative Faux Fur Throw Pillow Covers Velvet Fluffy Cushion Covers for Living Room Bed Couch Sofa Chair, 18x18 Black(No Insert)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WnEdDrVBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Furry & Fluffy Texture】Fuzzy pillow covers are soft and fluffy, and a fun pop of an unexpected texture in the home decor. The faux fur pillowcases are made to be cuddly and with the premium stitching craftsmanship, which makes the set unique and the solid color looks great with about any furniture. 【One Side Faux Fur Material】The furry pillow covers has one side fluffy texture, quality feels super durable, color is rich and the faux fur/fluff is so soft and gorgeous. Very stylish and brings life to the other accents. The back is a soft velvet, is a nice suede feeling! 【Well Hidden Zipper】The spring throw pillow covers well hidden zipper closure. Zipper is extremely well-hidden and zipper opening on the pillow cover is wide enough that you will have no trouble getting the inserts inside. The zipper and seams are so nicely done that it may take you few seconds to find the opening. 【Easy to Care & Machine Washable】Furry pillow covers are machine washable, with cold water at low speed separated from other clothing. When they come out of the bag, they may appear matted and stringy, when you first receive the set we recommend running a sticky roll lint remover over them to remove any loose fuzzies which will prevent shedding while in use. 【Widely Used & Package Included】This cushion covers can be widely used in sofas, beds, chairs, living rooms, offices, cars, etc. If you are going for a Boho vibe, this furry cushion cover is absolutely perfect to add to the mix! And also will works well with your winter wonderland theme. The package included 2 pieces pillow covers. No Inserts!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WnEdDrVBS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JLCROTENGRA","source_asin":"B097TZW81T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-377971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097TZW81T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097TZW81T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
